1
00:00:01,266 --> 00:00:02,333
You brought 200,000

2
00:00:02,733 --> 00:00:04,166
Are you treating me like a beggar

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,600
It's business

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,500
You ask high

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,366
And counter low

6
00:00:07,566 --> 00:00:08,633
If you think one million is too little

7
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:09,400
We can negotiate

8
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,433
Mr. Lewes

9
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:11,200
Name your price

10
00:00:11,366 --> 00:00:12,233
It's not about money

11
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,333
That previous special feed

12
00:00:14,333 --> 00:00:15,600
laced with hormones

13
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:17,233
was produced by you right

14
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:18,666
My formula

15
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:19,866
Even if I sell it

16
00:00:20,033 --> 00:00:21,666
I will sell it to an ethical company

17
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,600
A corrupt factory like yours

18
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:24,233
Is out of the question

19
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,033
Lewes

20
00:00:26,233 --> 00:00:27,300
Don't be ungrateful

21
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,700
Calling you Mr. Lewes

22
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Is giving you face

23
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:31,266
You really think you're a big shot

24
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,200
Ms. Zoe

25
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,166
The door is right there

26
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:34,100
See yourself out

27
00:00:35,366 --> 00:00:36,866
There is nothing I want

28
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,033
that I cannot get

29
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,633
Just you wait

30
00:00:44,566 --> 00:00:45,433
This Zoe

31
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:46,866
probably won't let this go easily

32
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:48,266
We will deal with whatever comes

33
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:49,133
Don't worry

34
00:00:49,533 --> 00:00:50,066
By the way

35
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:51,933
The new batch of forest frogs arrives tomorrow

36
00:00:52,033 --> 00:00:52,900
But the workers we hired

37
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:53,933
had some ticket issues

38
00:00:54,066 --> 00:00:55,300
and won't arrive for three or four days

39
00:00:55,433 --> 00:00:56,100
These next few days

40
00:00:56,133 --> 00:00:57,200
will be tough on you and my parents

41
00:00:57,533 --> 00:00:58,333
We are family

42
00:00:58,333 --> 00:00:59,133
Why say that

43
00:01:01,233 --> 00:01:02,033
How are things

44
00:01:02,266 --> 00:01:03,100
with your family

45
00:01:04,166 --> 00:01:04,800
I don't know

46
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:06,933
My parents aren't picking up my calls

47
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:07,966
or replying to my texts

48
00:01:10,333 --> 00:01:10,966
Lewes

49
00:01:11,733 --> 00:01:13,166
Daniel is a bit of a jerk

50
00:01:13,766 --> 00:01:14,166
But
